{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09147","headline":"赠别河南李功曹 · 韦应物","name":"赠别河南李功曹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"耿耿抱私戚，寥寥独掩扉。\n临觞自不饮，况与故人违。\n故人方琢磨，瓌朗代所稀。\n宪礼更右职，文翰洒天机。\n聿来自东山，羣彦仰余辉。\n谈笑取高第，绾绶即言归。\n洛都游燕地，千里及芳菲。\n今朝章台别，杨柳亦依依。\n云霞未改色，山川犹夕晖。\n忽复不相见，心思乱霏霏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09147.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09147","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}